Z||000002||rogergarrison||06-23-2001||07:13 PM||||detailing!!! like engine and interior. about all you might need is a spray can of black, a few little bottles of colors like silver and red. Touch up and clean everything you can. take off cooling tube to coil,alt and steelwool/polish them. they can be made to look almost chrome. Always very time consuming but very low cost. You could prob spend a whole weekend on it.||||reg||1
