Z||000010||fropuff||06-24-2001||12:09 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrgone:<BR><B>how much are those tinted licence plate covers? i want 2</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>&gt;I'm sure you could get two of them for $20.  Or if you have red light cameras in your state, you can get the covers that fool the cameras for $40.  Either way, they're illegal.  When I got my ticket, the stupid cop told me he'd ticket me $75 the next time he saw me with them on.  I'd give you mine, but I ripped them off and threw them right at the mother f**cker.  Money sucks, doesn't it?  Especially when you spend it all on pretty much nothing, and something mechanical screws up.  Good luck!  <P>||||reg||1
