Z||000013||trigger||06-25-2001||02:13 PM||||I replaced the air box.  Actually I'm doing it right now.  I jacked up the left rear and put it on a jack stand.  Pulled the wheel.  Took out the wheel liner, the took out the air box(four bolts).  Went to Ace and got a piece of 3 in. diameter 12 in. long pvc pipe for $.40.  I'm gonna put that in then try making a scoop.  I think I'll go finish it now.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif"> ||||reg||1
