Z||000015||Ken Wittlief||06-25-2001||04:19 PM||||Im skeptical about taking the airbox out.<P>that seems to be some kind of expansion chamber in there, and I suspect the engineers had some idea what they were doing.<P> if you take it out completely you will be sucking air from under the car, where is gonna be dustier<P>if you put a pipe in to replace it - then I wanna see the before and after 0 to 60mph and 1/4 miles times for your car on this mod.<P> i would keep it in one piece when you take it out - just in case the engineers really did know what they were doing - they wouldnt have molded that big thing in plastic in there without a good reason - the molds for that part had to cost $100,000 at least.||||reg||1
